Bug found in Phase 4 manual verification: after a floor walk Teddy teleported back to his start point. Root cause: arrive() preferred stale state.position (the walk START) over state.target, so the screen repositioned Teddy backwards on arrival. Fix: target wins when present (already-standing and reduced-motion arrivals keep position). TDD: failing arrival-position test added first (RED), then fix (GREEN) — 90/90. Verified live: feet rest exactly at the tapped point after the walk.
